<div id="urduTextPath">عون و محمد (ع)/جب زینبِ غریب کے رن میں پسر لڑے</div>
<p>jab zainab-e- ghareeb ke ran me pisar lade<br />
tanha lade ye, aah wo sab ahl-e- shar lade<br />
kis khoobsurti se ali ke jigar lade<br />
ek shor padgaya ke ghazab sher-e- nar lade</p>

<p>wirsa unhe mila hai janab-e- ameer ka<br />
ye zor sab hai sher ki beti ke sher ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>zainab jo nange paau'n khadi thi qarib -e- dar<br />
abbas jaake dete the ye dam badam qabar<br />
ro-e na ab huzoor mohim hochuki hai sar<br />
laakho'n se lad rahe hai ghazab aapke pisar</p>

<p>zor aaj phir dikha diya qaibar kushai ka<br />
ab to unhi ke haath hai maida'n laddai ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aansu baha ke bint-e- ali ne kaha ke haa'n<br />
de aur himmate'n unhe qallaaqe- ins-o- jaa'n<br />
bachhe kaha'n, hazaro ka wo maareka kaha'n<br />
kuch ho unhe falak ne, na hone diya jawaa'n</p>

<p>bekas hoo'n aur us pa mujhe etemaad hai<br />
qaaleq wo de ke jo mere dil ki murad hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhaiyya kuch apne beto'n ka mujh ko nahi qayaal<br />
marjaye ladke ya ke ho taapo'n se paayemaal<br />
sadqe karoo'n hazaar jo aise ho nounehaal<br />
sab doulate lute, pa bache fatima ka laal</p>

<p>aaye behen pa wo jo balaa unpa aayi ho<br />
dunya me koi ho ke na ho mera bhaai ho<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye zikr tha ke bhaai ko hazrat ne di sadaa<br />
abbas aao ghir gaye zainab ke dilruba<br />
doudhe sadaa ye sunte hi abbas-e- bawafaa<br />
asnaa-e- raah me ali akbar ne ye kaha</p>

<p>zinda rakha falak ne ye aansu bahane ko<br />
chaliye huzoor jaate hai laashe uthaane ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaari bahen ke beto'n ka dekha jo sheh ne haal<br />
tan chaak chaak hai gule sad barg ki misaal<br />
uljhe hai pech khaye huwe gesu'o ke baal<br />
oode hai hont chand se chehre lahu se laal</p>

<p>mathe hai shaq saro'n se amaame bhi door hai<br />
sab choti choti phasliya tegho'u se choor hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaye gardano'n ke tale haath deke sha<br />
mu se milao mu ke mera haal hai tabah<br />
aakho me dam tha bolte kyu kar wo rashke maa<br />
rote the nabz dekhke abbase arsh jaa</p>

<p>dunya se kooch karte the bachhe pale huwe<br />
haathou me the hussain ke manke dhale huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kuch kuch abhi tha dam ke unhe le chale imaam<br />
ek laash ko to aap liye the shah-e- anaam<br />
aur ek laash hazrate abbas-e- nek naam<br />
qaima tha saamne ke biza-at huwi tamaam</p>

<p>jeete na pahonche haaye ghazab qaimagaah me<br />
dono sagheer margaye asnaa-e- raah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaye roke hazrate abbas-e- naamwar<br />
chota tamaam hogaya ya shah-e- bahrobar<br />
hazrat pukaare haath kaleje pa maar kar<br />
hai hai bada bhi mar gaya veera'n huwa ye ghar</p>

<p>maa muntazar hai chaak garebaa'n kiye huwe<br />
kis mu se jaau'n qaime me laashe liye huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>
zainab ke dil ko hogayi waa'n qud baqud qabar<br />
jaa baithi aap matame saf par jhuka ke sar<br />
laaye hussain dono ke laashe lahu me tar<br />
farmaya haaye lut gaya bekas bahan ka ghar</p>

<p>do qanjar ek baar kaleje pa chal gaye<br />
aaye the tum se milne ko par dam nikal gaye<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>